# Typography

Use **HYWenHei-85W** as the primary font everywhere in this portfolio.

## Font constant

Import and use the shared constant from `src/utils/constants.ts`:

```ts
import { FONT } from "../../utils/constants";

// In styled-components
font-family: ${FONT.primary};
```

## Fallback stack

When writing raw CSS or when the constant isn't available, use:

```css
font-family: "HYWenHei-85W", system-ui, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
```

## Rules

- Never use Georgia, Times New Roman, or other serif fonts as primary
- Prefer `FONT.primary` in styled-components over hardcoded strings
- Form inputs, buttons, labels, and all text should use this font stack
